@startuml
title C4 Level 2 - TARGET StockApp, Mobile local conservado
actor Owner
package "StockApp" {
  rectangle "Mobile\nExpo/RN + Domain/Application" as mobile <<Container>>
  database "SQLite\nReplica aceptada + propuestas/outbox\nTARGET connected metadata" as local <<Container>>
  rectangle "Web SPA\nReact/Vite online-first" as web <<Container>>
  rectangle "API\nFastify + Better Auth + shared domain" as api <<Container>>
  database "PostgreSQL Railway\nAceptados / receipts / changes / auth" as db <<Container>>
}
Owner --> mobile
Owner --> web
mobile --> local : Transaccion inmediata offline
mobile --> api : Comandos + pull/cursor
web --> api : HTTPS con cookie host-only API
api --> db : Unico writer; lock Inventory
note bottom of local
  CURRENT SQLite ocho tablas local-only.
  Replica/propuestas/outbox son TARGET, no implementados.
end note
@enduml
